# Gemini API key — used ONLY for:
#   1. column mapping of unknown carrier formats (headers + 3 sample rows, never claim data in bulk)
#   2. vision extraction of scanned pages (M6 fallback)
# The app runs without it: saved profiles and the heuristic mapper cover known formats,
# and scanned pages are flagged for manual entry instead.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional override of the Gemini model used for mapping and vision.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
